<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore says comfortable with its echange rate.</title>
<headline>Singapore says comfortable with its echange rate.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore officials said on Frdiay they were comfortable with the current exchange rate of the Singapore dollar against its U.S. counterpart.</p>
</text>
